{"id":"76fb10ce5cb9e59d","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model.md","title":"ZFC Model2 Direct Limit Model","display":"df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model — ZFC Model2 Direct Limit Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model","58-df-zfc-model7-direct-limit-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model — ZFC Model2 Direct Limit Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model</span><span>58-df-zfc-model7-direct-limit-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model — ZFC Model2 Direct Limit Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md\">../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce82854692ec65c\" href=\"?note=4ce82854692ec65c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal L,C,\\delta,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{Emb},I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,j\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathcal L,C,\\delta,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{Emb},I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,j\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ce82854692ec65c\" href=\"?note=4ce82854692ec65c\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S\\)</span> is the four-place set-system predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md\">../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\)</span> is a chosen set-sized collection of structures and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Emb}:\\mathcal S\\times\\mathcal S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Emb}:\\mathcal S\\times\\mathcal S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\\)</span> supplies its embedding sets</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2DirectLimitModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2DirectLimitModel}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7DirectLimitModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7DirectLimitModel}_S\\)</span> are the four- and five-place predicates defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2DirectLimitModel}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2DirectLimitModel}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcModel7DirectLimitModel}_S(M,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{Emb})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal D=\\langle I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,j\\rangle\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land M\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\operatorname{Emb}:\\mathcal S\\times\\mathcal S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(M_\\bullet(i)\\in\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to j(i,k)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),M_\\bullet(k)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists q\\in\\mathcal U^I\\;\\left[\\forall i\\in I\\;(q(i)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),M))\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to q(k)\\circ j(i,k)=q(i))\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\left.\\qquad\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal U^I\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall i\\in I\\;(h(i)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),N))\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to h(k)\\circ j(i,k)=h(i))\\right]\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M,N)\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;(u\\circ q(i)=h(i))\\right)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcModel7DirectLimitModel}_S(M,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{Emb})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal D=\\langle I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,j\\rangle\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land M\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\operatorname{Emb}:\\mathcal S\\times\\mathcal S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(M_\\bullet(i)\\in\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to j(i,k)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),M_\\bullet(k)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists q\\in\\mathcal U^I\\;\\left[\\forall i\\in I\\;(q(i)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),M))\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to q(k)\\circ j(i,k)=q(i))\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\left.\\qquad\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal U^I\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall i\\in I\\;(h(i)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),N))\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to h(k)\\circ j(i,k)=h(i))\\right]\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M,N)\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;(u\\circ q(i)=h(i))\\right)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对初等包含链，直接极限就是规范的并结构，第一式复用该规范定义。</li>\n<li>第二式给出一般有向结构系统的余锥及其泛性质；它修复了原式只写商集载体、未定义结构解释与规范映射的问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"4ce82854692ec65c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"4ce82854692ec65c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S\\subseteq V^4$（见 [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-model9-union-of-elementary-chain.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S$ is the four-place set-system predicate from [[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathcal L,C,\\delta,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{Emb},I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Emb}:\\mathcal S\\times\\mathcal S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2DirectLimitModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7DirectLimitModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2DirectLimitModel}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel9UnionOfElementaryChain}_S(M,C,\\delta,\\mathcal L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcModel7DirectLimitModel}_S(M,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal S,\\operatorname{Emb})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathcal D=\\langle I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,j\\rangle\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land M\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\operatorname{Emb}:\\mathcal S\\times\\mathcal S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(M_\\bullet(i)\\in\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to j(i,k)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),M_\\bullet(k)))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists q\\in\\mathcal U^I\\;\\left[\\forall i\\in I\\;(q(i)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),M))\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to q(k)\\circ j(i,k)=q(i))\\right.\\\\\n&\\left.\\qquad\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal U^I\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall i\\in I\\;(h(i)\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M_\\bullet(i),N))\\land\\forall i,k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\to h(k)\\circ j(i,k)=h(i))\\right]\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Emb}(M,N)\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;(u\\circ q(i)=h(i))\\right)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2728,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2741","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model.md|58-df-zfc-model2-direct-limit-model]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3a9f5d3a8e080215","4ce82854692ec65c"]}